WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:12.137
What's this sound I'm hearing
with my keen ears?

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.974
Sure, I've got good hearing,
but that's not the point here.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:21.146
It's the sound of desire, of course

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:25.734
-Coming from deep down inside
-My lord.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.527
Who could that be?

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:30.488
Isn't that the young master
who was looking for his cousin?

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:35.076
I was mistaken.
I never imagined you would be

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.162
-so well-endowed.
-Goodness!

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:39.080
-You know nothing at all!
-Don't be silly, please.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.458
Listen I'll show you how it's done

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.754
What is big and long
May not be the best

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:50.425
A hand plow when you dig for clams
Is better than a pickaxe!

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:54.846
Don't go tossing your pail in a stream
Just blow gently

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:57.265
Put your lips down
Suck, suck, suck

00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:00.560
Hey now, Director,
will you stop teasing us like that?

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:05.899
Huh? A waterwheel?

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.068
Slosh and…

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:10.028
Squishing here, squishing there

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:15.575
Thump and thud
It digs mighty well

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:17.911
You must hold a flower gently.

00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:20.789
Hold it too tight, and it will break.

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:25.126
At this rate, the iron will never get hot.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.545
Planning to dig in dry ground?

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:32.008
Would you care to check
for yourself, young master?

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:36.930
That's right, is it going in?

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:40.225
Let's check
It's going in

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:42.560
For the pestle's standing
Tall and hard

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:45.688
And is going up, going down
All over again

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.816
It's going in

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.984
Splash! Trickle!

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.444
Squeaky here, squeaky there

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:55.156
Thump and thud
It pounds mighty well

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.325
Well, that young master
Is nowhere to be found at all

00:01:57.408 --> 00:02:00.120
We should not be doing this here.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:02.122
In time or space

00:02:02.205 --> 00:02:05.792
In a palanquin

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:09.921
Swaying, bouncing
Heaving and bobbing

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:13.716
Let's check
It's going in

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.595
"My lord,
just how many women have you seduced?"

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.640
Do you keep track…

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.227
of how many grapes you've eaten?

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.272
Well now,
a wise answer to a foolish question.

00:02:27.355 --> 00:02:29.774
"So of course I've heard the rumors,

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:33.153
but I never imagined you this lewd."

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.113
And those whispers…

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.740
What were they?

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:41.619
Goodness, you don't even know.

00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:47.292
"They say
you're a gentleman of the night."

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.295
A gentleman of the night?

00:02:50.378 --> 00:02:55.133
Right
Not just a gentleman, but a saintly one

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:57.385
If he is truly that…

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:02.223
takes great delight in meeting talent

00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:06.227
wherever he goes
and then offering them his guidance.

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:08.229
And tonight, I shall…

00:03:10.106 --> 00:03:13.651
take great delight in giving you guidance
as a gentleman always should.

00:03:19.073 --> 00:03:23.953
Now, this is the teaching of Xunzi.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:32.962
Drift and glide Like floating along

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:38.885
Like strolling along
On feathery clouds

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:42.639
Then suddenly you go crashing down

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:46.643
Is this a dream?

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:50.813
Ah

00:03:52.315 --> 00:03:57.820
Did you just wake me up?

00:03:58.446 --> 00:04:01.658
Vanishing just like bubbles

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:04.869
It can never be captured

00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:10.583
Like a fleeting shadow
It goes around and brings you right back

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:15.296
-To where you just started
-Cousin!

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.966
Dear cousin!

00:04:20.009 --> 00:04:21.928
-Dear cousin!
-It's love

00:04:22.011 --> 00:04:23.346
Cousin!

00:04:23.846 --> 00:04:26.891
-It's love
-Cousin!

00:04:26.975 --> 00:04:33.189
What is this love?
A love that haunts me even in dreams

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:38.987
This love
Also when I'm awake

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:43.241
This love

00:04:43.324 --> 00:04:47.245
It is so cruel

00:04:47.745 --> 00:04:52.750
Why are you holding me back?

00:04:52.834 --> 00:04:57.046
This love

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:02.051
My love

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:11.936
Sweet love of mine…

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:34.500
I'm sure you've heard
from the Left State Councilor already,

00:05:34.584 --> 00:05:35.585
but I…

00:05:36.419 --> 00:05:38.463
I shall be staying up here for a while.

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:42.967
Nevertheless, whatever the reasons are,
I guess it's fate.

00:05:45.136 --> 00:05:47.096
Eun-sil, please say that's all I can hear.

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:50.892
-My lady says she--
-I do regret that I didn't say farewell

00:05:51.976 --> 00:05:53.353
the last time we were together.

00:06:00.443 --> 00:06:03.905
I was merely wondering
if you had returned home safely.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.367
But if you turn away from me,
what choice have I got left?

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:11.412
Or did you not understand me?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.751
Tell him there is no misunderstanding.

00:06:17.585 --> 00:06:20.088
My lady says there is no misunderstanding.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.177
The first time I saw you,

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.596
I found this where you'd been standing,
my lady.

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:37.939
I shall accept your thanks
in the form of a letter addressed to me.

00:06:39.273 --> 00:06:41.901
There are many ears
and many eyes about us.

00:06:41.984 --> 00:06:45.238
He praised your cousin
in truly effusive ways.

00:06:45.321 --> 00:06:47.532
For a man of so few words, that is.

00:06:47.615 --> 00:06:49.283
My lady. My lady!

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:51.244
Madam is approaching.

00:06:52.703 --> 00:06:54.580
This will be the death of me.

00:06:54.664 --> 00:06:56.958
Please, my lord, don't do this.

00:06:57.041 --> 00:06:58.209
Please give it to me.

00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:00.294
My lady.

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:01.838
Oh, he's precocious,

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:03.798
-but very delightful as well.
-All right.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.760
Lady of the First Rank.

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:10.096
Oh, my dear. You're here.

00:07:13.057 --> 00:07:17.645
I saw you from afar
and I almost spilled over in delight.

00:07:17.728 --> 00:07:20.731
Come, let's go now.

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:25.027
I can't wait for today's poetry reading.

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:26.863
Should you not feel up to it,

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:30.116
I shall be glad to write to you first.

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:43.629
You will do it, won't you?

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:49.969
Yes, I will. Please make haste.

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.354
Right here.

00:08:06.903 --> 00:08:08.196
Are you unsettled?

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.324
I was on my way to the rear garden
with the lady,

00:08:11.407 --> 00:08:13.576
and when I saw you like this,
I came to see.

00:08:15.703 --> 00:08:16.913
You need not worry.

00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:19.749
I'm quite sure the lady noticed nothing.

00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:28.341
You can tell me anything and everything.

00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:32.386
I humbly apologize. The truth is, I…

00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:47.401
I should've come to you straightaway

00:08:47.902 --> 00:08:50.696
to thank you
for what you did for me last time.

00:08:52.323 --> 00:08:54.242
Please forgive my tardiness.

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:28.442
I can just feel the heartbeat of a mother.

00:09:29.443 --> 00:09:33.990
Oh, then this time,
I shall read a poem I have prepared.

00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:38.578
"My lover has not yet returned

00:09:38.661 --> 00:09:40.705
Though the full moon is waning now

00:09:40.788 --> 00:09:45.626
The endless sound of the loom
Fills my lonely heart"

00:10:03.686 --> 00:10:07.398
Well, were you attempting
to avoid me again

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.358
because you were lonely?

00:10:10.276 --> 00:10:11.485
How are you getting along?

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:13.654
I must say it's easy.

00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:16.907
So much so, I almost feel sorry for you.

00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:18.951
You're in good spirits.

00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:22.121
You must remember,
when the task is near completion,

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:24.498
to stop by for a visit, won't you?

00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:25.583
Why?

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.793
Are you thinking of rehearsing

00:10:28.336 --> 00:10:30.046
before I receive just compensation?

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.381
It would perhaps be better

00:10:32.882 --> 00:10:34.634
if you stopped by during the night.

00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:36.844
I tremble with anticipation.

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:42.391
Uh-uh-uh.

00:10:45.227 --> 00:10:47.188
Here we are.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.201
Hmm?

00:11:10.294 --> 00:11:11.337
Hmm.

00:11:15.716 --> 00:11:16.926
Here they are.

00:11:19.887 --> 00:11:21.138
Huh.

00:11:22.807 --> 00:11:24.517
You have worked very hard

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:29.563
on copying the chapter
on the introduction to Confucian learning.

00:11:30.272 --> 00:11:32.650
"A young woman,
upon reaching ten years of age,

00:11:32.733 --> 00:11:34.193
should come and go modestly.

00:11:34.276 --> 00:11:36.654
At 15, she should put her hair up
with a binyeo.

00:11:36.737 --> 00:11:38.948
And before turning 20,
she should be married."

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:41.200
That is correct.

00:11:41.283 --> 00:11:42.868
Like a flower, she should bloom.

00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:46.455
Yes, indeed.

00:11:46.539 --> 00:11:47.915
Go on, take it. Take it.

00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:49.959
Come on, take it. It's all right.

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:53.254
Come, come!
Your lady has promised to write back.

00:11:54.296 --> 00:11:56.716
-Have you forgotten who you are?
-There, there.

00:11:57.341 --> 00:11:59.427
It's all right. Take it, hmm?

00:12:03.431 --> 00:12:04.682
Son of a…

00:12:28.706 --> 00:12:32.084
It is written that a husband
may take a second wife,

00:12:32.168 --> 00:12:35.421
but there is no mention of a wife
taking a second husband.

00:12:35.504 --> 00:12:39.175
If one's conduct is at odds
with the will of heaven and earth,

00:12:39.258 --> 00:12:41.761
the heaven's punishment shall rain down.

00:12:43.345 --> 00:12:45.681
I have duly received your reply.

00:12:45.765 --> 00:12:48.726
Thanks to you,
this has been an informative time

00:12:48.809 --> 00:12:52.813
in which I could learn the kind of things
ladies study and memorize.

00:12:54.398 --> 00:12:57.818
If one's conduct is at odds
with the spirits of heaven and earth,

00:12:57.902 --> 00:13:00.279
the heaven's punishment shall rain down.

00:13:00.362 --> 00:13:03.324
If there is fault
in a woman's manners and loyalty…

00:13:04.241 --> 00:13:06.994
I saw a pair of cuckoos
in the rear garden.

00:13:07.077 --> 00:13:11.248
The male and female were sitting
side by side, singing so sweetly.

00:13:11.749 --> 00:13:13.042
As I stood there, enraptured,

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:16.712
listening to the noble song of love
sung by such lovely creatures,

00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:19.340
I couldn't help but feel jealous.

00:13:22.343 --> 00:13:26.263
If one's conduct is at odds
with the spirits of heaven and earth,

00:13:26.347 --> 00:13:28.974
the heaven's punishment shall rain down.

00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:32.186
If there is fault
in a woman's manners and loyalty,

00:13:32.269 --> 00:13:34.814
her husband will soon treat her coldly.

00:14:13.936 --> 00:14:15.062
Eun-sil…

00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:21.610
Eun-sil, stop making that racket.

00:14:23.571 --> 00:14:24.572
Hmm.

00:14:48.095 --> 00:14:50.514
Yesterday, I took a walk
with Young Master In-ho,

00:14:50.598 --> 00:14:52.516
and we discussed many things.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.727
I did not probe any further, though,

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.354
for fear the young master's
feelings might be hurt.

00:14:57.438 --> 00:15:01.150
But it seems he feels the absence
of his late brother quite acutely.

00:15:01.233 --> 00:15:02.234
Lord.

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:03.903
My lord.

00:15:04.486 --> 00:15:07.031
I am aware I am overstepping,

00:15:07.114 --> 00:15:09.491
but I wished
that I could help fill that void,

00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:11.660
however modestly.

00:15:13.954 --> 00:15:17.124
If one's conduct is at odds
with the spirits of heaven and earth,

00:15:17.207 --> 00:15:19.126
the heaven's punishment will rain down.

00:15:19.209 --> 00:15:22.379
If there is fault
in a woman's manners and loyalty,

00:15:22.463 --> 00:15:24.548
her husband will soon treat her coldly.

00:15:34.516 --> 00:15:35.517
Oh my.

00:15:36.977 --> 00:15:38.896
What'd you say your name was again?

00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:41.315
You remember, don't you?

00:15:42.149 --> 00:15:44.526
Chil-seong. It's Chil-seong.

00:15:46.862 --> 00:15:47.863
I'm very insulted.

00:15:47.947 --> 00:15:49.365
Like "Seven Names"?

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:53.035
A fitting name for a servant.

00:15:54.828 --> 00:15:56.288
Ah, not so.

00:15:57.039 --> 00:16:00.250
When I was an infant,
I was known as Container.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.170
Then it was Dog Balls a while.

00:16:03.253 --> 00:16:05.130
Then Straw Mat, you know? Meongseok.

00:16:05.214 --> 00:16:07.257
'Cause I was beaten by a straw mat.

00:16:12.596 --> 00:16:14.014
How can that make you laugh?

00:16:14.598 --> 00:16:17.476
Anyway, who gave you
the name of Chil-seong?

00:16:18.102 --> 00:16:19.144
Cho Won.

00:16:20.729 --> 00:16:21.855
Lord Cho Won.

00:16:23.107 --> 00:16:24.984
I have served seven masters in all.

00:16:25.067 --> 00:16:27.736
A different family name
for each one that I served.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.905
Which is why I'm Chil-seong,
"Seven Names."

00:16:30.406 --> 00:16:33.367
Imploring that the Chos
would be my last master.

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:36.328
With that name,
I couldn't be sold to anyone else.

00:16:36.412 --> 00:16:39.289
It's been a difficult life
for you as well.

00:16:40.416 --> 00:16:41.500
Wait, move aside.

00:16:43.377 --> 00:16:44.461
Oh, dear.

00:16:46.255 --> 00:16:48.882
Oh, dear. This…

00:16:51.385 --> 00:16:54.471
Oh, my God.
You might have taken care of this.

00:16:54.555 --> 00:16:57.057
I…

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:01.395
My lady.

00:17:01.895 --> 00:17:03.063
Who's there?

00:17:03.147 --> 00:17:05.566
Who else? It's Eun-sil.

00:17:06.108 --> 00:17:07.776
I have something for you.

00:17:14.742 --> 00:17:16.410
Where on earth have you been?

00:17:33.385 --> 00:17:34.928
There's a letter for you.

00:17:37.473 --> 00:17:38.474
A letter?

00:17:40.809 --> 00:17:44.313
If one's conduct is at odds
with the spirits of heaven and earth,

00:17:44.855 --> 00:17:47.191
the heaven's punishment shall rain down.

00:17:47.941 --> 00:17:50.486
If there is fault
in a woman's manners and loyalty…

00:17:57.201 --> 00:18:00.204
Here. Insert this and deliver it to her.

00:18:01.205 --> 00:18:02.206
Huh?

00:18:08.796 --> 00:18:09.922
Hmm…

00:18:10.798 --> 00:18:11.965
Hmm…

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.635
Right.

00:18:14.718 --> 00:18:17.930
I shall prepare a concoction
of pomegranate and velvet antler.

00:18:18.013 --> 00:18:20.015
Please make sure she drinks it
before going to bed.

00:18:20.516 --> 00:18:23.018
To ensure your body
is in child bearing condition,

00:18:23.602 --> 00:18:25.854
you must be sure to take it
every single day.

00:18:27.898 --> 00:18:30.192
I am grateful, my lord. Thank you so much.

00:18:32.736 --> 00:18:34.738
You should be thanking my lady.

00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:37.825
Isn't that right, my lady?

00:19:00.514 --> 00:19:03.225
Keep a fair countenance
and hold fast to your virtue.

00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:05.811
Conduct yourself with modesty

00:19:05.894 --> 00:19:08.814
-and decorum, and serve your husband.
-Replying to a blank letter, huh?

00:19:10.315 --> 00:19:11.775
She isn't even reading them, is she?

00:19:11.859 --> 00:19:13.443
Oh my. Aren't you pretty?

00:19:13.527 --> 00:19:15.696
My lady, how about this one?

00:19:19.491 --> 00:19:21.410
Do you even read…

00:19:23.579 --> 00:19:25.289
all the letters I've been sending?

00:19:25.372 --> 00:19:27.749
How can you possibly be so impolite?

00:19:29.293 --> 00:19:33.046
Without even bothering to see or read
what is in my heart, you send a reply?

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.339
My lord…

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:39.386
have you not ignored the many requests
that I've earnestly made?

00:19:40.304 --> 00:19:43.807
All the while,
I have kept every one of my promises.

00:19:49.146 --> 00:19:51.231
Have you no pity for my aching heart?

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:10.709
Hmm.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.593
Tie it securely.

00:20:20.093 --> 00:20:22.095
Take those. You can take those with you.

00:20:40.822 --> 00:20:44.243
Heave ho.

00:20:47.955 --> 00:20:49.414
Hmm.

00:21:00.759 --> 00:21:01.760
Mother.

00:21:02.302 --> 00:21:05.222
I shall very shortly be at your side,

00:21:06.723 --> 00:21:07.933
dear husband.

00:21:08.517 --> 00:21:09.977
Take it easy.

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:14.398
Dear me, we didn't know
the elders of this household left

00:21:14.481 --> 00:21:16.191
for the end of the mourning period

00:21:16.275 --> 00:21:19.027
and brought along this precious alcohol!

00:21:19.111 --> 00:21:20.112
Huh?

00:21:21.238 --> 00:21:22.781
So now, what do I do with this?

00:21:22.864 --> 00:21:24.408
-Oh my.
-What is it? Alcohol?

00:21:25.659 --> 00:21:26.743
Hey!

00:21:27.244 --> 00:21:29.746
-Here we go.
-Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, come on!

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.415
What do you think you're doing?

00:21:31.498 --> 00:21:33.458
Chil-seong,
I didn't take you for such a man.

00:21:33.542 --> 00:21:35.210
What am I supposed to do?

00:21:35.294 --> 00:21:37.963
Should I just disobey orders
from my lord? Can I?

00:21:38.046 --> 00:21:39.047
Everyone, look at this!

00:21:39.131 --> 00:21:41.508
This piece of land
will be quite fertile next year,

00:21:41.591 --> 00:21:43.176
so you can plant whatever you want.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:45.137
-Hey, hey, hey, hey! Hey! Hey!
-Don't do that!

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.180
That's precious!
Why would he tell you to throw it away?

00:21:47.264 --> 00:21:49.182
Hurry up, hurry up!
Continue as your lord commanded.

00:21:49.266 --> 00:21:50.267
Keep throwing it away!

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.270
-Throw it away? Wait, should I?
-Come on! Here. Pour it off into this.

00:21:53.353 --> 00:21:55.772
Throw it away by pouring it off here.
You're not disobeying.

00:21:55.856 --> 00:21:57.607
-What do you think you're doing?
-Throwing it away.

00:21:57.691 --> 00:22:00.902
We have some leftovers for the
ancestral rites in the kitchen, don't we?

00:22:00.986 --> 00:22:02.362
Hey, Chil-seong!

00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:04.531
You're a right good scoundrel
of a servant!

00:23:37.624 --> 00:23:40.127
-Wait, stop!
-Hey, Chil-seong!

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:42.170
You're a right good scoundrel
of a servant!

00:23:42.254 --> 00:23:43.463
Stop wasting it!

00:23:51.888 --> 00:23:53.098
This is…

00:24:09.322 --> 00:24:11.324
With a face like this, really.

00:24:12.242 --> 00:24:14.703
And I've added so much sweet tenderness.

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:20.625
What else could you ask of me then, huh?

00:24:42.189 --> 00:24:45.025
Your reply is duly received.
Your handwriting is as beautiful…

00:24:45.108 --> 00:24:47.027
You are shameless and inconsiderate.

00:24:47.110 --> 00:24:48.695
I can scarcely believe
you've written me again

00:24:48.778 --> 00:24:50.197
even after my preposterous reply.

00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:52.407
Why on earth do you torment me so?

00:25:01.333 --> 00:25:03.126
Yesterday, I took a walk
with Young Master In-ho.

00:25:03.210 --> 00:25:04.211
We conversed on many topics.

00:25:04.294 --> 00:25:06.796
I was sure I judged you correctly.

00:25:06.880 --> 00:25:08.924
Deep in your heart, my lord,

00:25:09.007 --> 00:25:12.385
there is such gentleness,
such considerate regard.

00:25:12.969 --> 00:25:15.055
But for some unknown reason,

00:25:15.138 --> 00:25:18.475
when you say you wish to help
fill that void for the young master,

00:25:18.558 --> 00:25:20.393
I grow jealous of him.

00:25:21.603 --> 00:25:24.564
Surely I deserve to die
for having such thoughts.

00:25:33.281 --> 00:25:35.617
My lord, whom I miss so dearly.

00:25:35.700 --> 00:25:38.453
Appear before my eyes, I pray you.

00:25:39.496 --> 00:25:43.750
My heart is in turmoil,
and sleep has utterly forsaken me.

00:25:44.668 --> 00:25:47.796
Please appear before me,
if only in dreams.

00:26:14.698 --> 00:26:16.324
Eun-sil, are you there?

00:26:25.417 --> 00:26:26.501
Eun-sil.

00:26:32.632 --> 00:26:34.968
Don't be alarmed, my lady.
It is I, Cho Won.

00:26:38.555 --> 00:26:41.808
I have come here to see you.

00:26:41.891 --> 00:26:44.019
What peculiar words you speak, sir.

00:26:45.020 --> 00:26:46.396
Please leave at once.

00:26:46.479 --> 00:26:49.190
Then I shall pretend
this whole thing never happened.

00:26:49.733 --> 00:26:53.778
Do you mean to say
that you did not wish to see me?

00:26:54.988 --> 00:26:57.657
How could one so well-versed
in duty and propriety

00:26:58.325 --> 00:27:00.744
ask me such
an embarrassing question as that?

00:27:02.537 --> 00:27:03.872
Have I heard you right?

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:09.252
Do you consider me an embarrassment then?

00:27:17.927 --> 00:27:21.056
I have learned over time
that your heart resembles mine.

00:27:23.350 --> 00:27:25.060
So however could I not?

00:27:25.560 --> 00:27:27.687
However could I not have come to see you?

00:27:29.439 --> 00:27:30.565
Isn't that why…

00:27:32.359 --> 00:27:34.903
you have deigned to respond
to the letters I sent?

00:27:36.738 --> 00:27:37.947
I…

00:27:38.740 --> 00:27:41.201
have seen every single one
of your replies.

00:27:43.328 --> 00:27:45.789
Don't do this, my lord. I'm begging you.

00:27:49.542 --> 00:27:51.628
Why must you be so cruel to me?

00:27:52.921 --> 00:27:56.299
How can you aspire so earnestly to a fate…

00:27:58.426 --> 00:28:00.303
that cannot be in this life?

00:28:06.768 --> 00:28:07.852
If not in this life…

00:28:10.522 --> 00:28:11.856
then in the next…

00:28:14.025 --> 00:28:16.069
could you and I be together?

00:28:20.740 --> 00:28:23.034
If so, then I beg you…

00:28:25.495 --> 00:28:27.580
…send me to my next life right now.

00:28:31.918 --> 00:28:33.211
If you can't oblige…

00:28:41.469 --> 00:28:43.555
then there is no other choice.

00:28:46.933 --> 00:28:48.810
We shall be together in this life.

00:28:52.397 --> 00:28:53.773
Just as we are now.

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:13.668
Tonight, I am certain…

00:29:19.591 --> 00:29:21.676
in our dreams, we shall meet.

00:29:24.179 --> 00:29:25.513
I can swear to that.

00:29:52.582 --> 00:29:55.668
She's falling for it so easily,
it's almost disappointing.

00:29:59.672 --> 00:30:02.008
She might cry herself to sleep, I daresay.

00:30:21.694 --> 00:30:22.695
Madam.

00:30:22.779 --> 00:30:25.073
Lord Cho Won is here.

00:30:36.876 --> 00:30:39.420
You told me to come
when I felt it was almost done.

00:30:40.630 --> 00:30:43.132
So despite the lateness of the hour…

00:30:44.634 --> 00:30:46.803
I couldn't help but come.
My apologies, cousin.

00:30:46.886 --> 00:30:50.348
Well, I see you're optimistic
about your success.

00:30:51.474 --> 00:30:54.811
I have just now been with the young widow.

00:30:55.979 --> 00:30:57.272
Just the two of us alone.

00:30:58.022 --> 00:31:00.942
Most… discreetly.

00:31:02.235 --> 00:31:03.903
How very ingenious you are.

00:31:04.946 --> 00:31:07.991
There must have been
at least ten pairs of eyes observing.

00:31:10.285 --> 00:31:14.789
Yes, but what have I to fear
when I am guided by such clear intent?

00:31:14.873 --> 00:31:18.084
Especially now that the woman,
once biting and distant,

00:31:18.668 --> 00:31:21.337
is nestled in my arms so very sweetly?

00:31:23.047 --> 00:31:24.299
Nestled?

00:31:25.466 --> 00:31:26.885
The young widow?

00:31:26.968 --> 00:31:29.971
Isn't this her first time
in a man's embrace?

00:31:30.054 --> 00:31:32.223
She's all but melted in my arms.

00:31:35.643 --> 00:31:39.981
Honestly, I could not help but smile.

00:31:41.858 --> 00:31:46.529
Until tonight,
I had been acting as planned in advance.

00:31:48.031 --> 00:31:49.282
But now, I've…

00:31:52.243 --> 00:31:53.870
nearly been found out.

00:31:58.082 --> 00:31:59.542
Nearly found out?

00:32:00.335 --> 00:32:02.670
-On what score?
-Oh, I think you know.

00:32:07.842 --> 00:32:12.221
All this gaudy tomfoolery I indulge in.

00:32:14.015 --> 00:32:15.391
So what did you do then?

00:32:16.059 --> 00:32:18.811
You've made me most curious
to know the details.

00:32:22.523 --> 00:32:28.071
If I could be with you in our next life,
then I would like to…

00:32:30.156 --> 00:32:32.617
move on to that next life without delay.

00:32:34.035 --> 00:32:35.244
After all this time,

00:32:35.328 --> 00:32:40.124
I finally encounter a man
who leaves me breathless.

00:32:49.676 --> 00:32:51.844
These hands of yours, strong and thick,

00:32:52.845 --> 00:32:55.056
how I've missed holding them so close.

00:33:00.520 --> 00:33:01.688
Just as I…

00:33:04.524 --> 00:33:05.733
every single day…

00:33:08.194 --> 00:33:10.697
have missed the sound
of your sweet breath.

00:33:14.367 --> 00:33:16.285
As I'm listening to this,

00:33:16.369 --> 00:33:19.872
I know these words will get me wet
and keep me wet all night.

00:33:53.948 --> 00:33:56.826
"Again and again, my legs keep spreading,

00:33:56.909 --> 00:33:59.120
but I have no husband to fill the void"…

00:33:59.620 --> 00:34:03.249
These hands of yours,
strong and thick, how I've missed them.

00:34:03.332 --> 00:34:05.376
"Come here, very close,

00:34:05.460 --> 00:34:09.088
and scold my womanhood most moist,
I beg of you."

00:34:13.134 --> 00:34:14.510
"Bun-hui"?

00:34:15.720 --> 00:34:17.638
Hmm.

00:34:27.398 --> 00:34:28.608
So why…

00:34:30.193 --> 00:34:33.279
Why is it that you only
brush her shoulders and then stopped?

00:34:37.116 --> 00:34:39.202
It's from So-ok's mother.

00:34:39.702 --> 00:34:41.496
The one who sells tobacco.

00:34:45.792 --> 00:34:48.169
Ladies who can't get me out of their heads

00:34:49.087 --> 00:34:50.713
are abundant across the nation.

00:34:50.797 --> 00:34:52.423
All eight provinces, I'm sure.

00:34:52.507 --> 00:34:53.925
She is just one of them.

00:34:54.008 --> 00:34:55.718
As you must be aware,

00:34:56.844 --> 00:35:01.557
if there's one thing a woman hates,
it's talk of other women one has seen.

00:35:02.058 --> 00:35:03.226
Wait a second.

00:35:04.310 --> 00:35:06.437
Have I been upsetting you so much now?

00:35:07.688 --> 00:35:08.689
Well, then.

00:35:10.691 --> 00:35:15.655
You still have the remnants
of a bitter smile on your brow.

00:35:16.572 --> 00:35:19.367
It would not do
for me to try to imitate it for you.

00:35:24.205 --> 00:35:26.207
Well, by way of apology,

00:35:27.875 --> 00:35:32.171
I shall entrust this letter to you,
dear cousin.

00:35:32.255 --> 00:35:35.675
I'm sure you'll find greater use for it
than I.

00:35:38.678 --> 00:35:41.639
I'm talking about the daughter
of the woman who wrote this, of course.

00:35:42.223 --> 00:35:43.391
Use this to teach her.

00:35:44.100 --> 00:35:46.561
I'm sure there's no better way
to make her a good concubine.

00:35:47.145 --> 00:35:49.981
Reciting this, as is,
will make my brother-in-law

00:35:51.357 --> 00:35:53.025
a happy man indeed.

00:35:57.446 --> 00:35:58.781
Count on me then.

00:35:59.991 --> 00:36:02.243
I shall put your apology to good use.

00:36:02.785 --> 00:36:07.165
I think someone else
may need it more than So-ok.

00:36:09.667 --> 00:36:12.378
I could give it to the young widow,
wouldn't that be kind?

00:36:15.173 --> 00:36:17.633
Ah. It is mine now,

00:36:18.217 --> 00:36:20.469
so your opinion about it isn't necessary.

00:36:26.392 --> 00:36:27.518
Oh, no.

00:36:29.145 --> 00:36:32.565
I'm seeing you swallowing
and gulping so nervously.

00:36:32.648 --> 00:36:36.152
I can only assume that you're flustered.

00:36:37.361 --> 00:36:38.487
Oh, dear.

00:36:38.571 --> 00:36:41.657
It would not do
for me to try to imitate it for you.

00:36:43.284 --> 00:36:44.368
On the contrary.

00:36:45.620 --> 00:36:46.704
It's just,

00:36:47.997 --> 00:36:49.749
I'm imagining how that young widow,

00:36:49.832 --> 00:36:52.501
upon reading this letter,
will react to my manhood.

00:36:55.588 --> 00:36:58.966
Oh, yes, do you think
she'll lose consciousness?

00:37:03.763 --> 00:37:04.889
Gye-hwa,

00:37:05.640 --> 00:37:07.558
would you possibly be outside?

00:37:07.642 --> 00:37:09.310
Did you call for me, ma'am?

00:37:09.977 --> 00:37:12.605
Go see the Left State Councilor's
daughter-in-law at once

00:37:12.688 --> 00:37:13.981
and bring her this letter.

00:37:17.318 --> 00:37:18.444
Gye-hwa.

00:37:19.153 --> 00:37:20.821
Did you hear me? What did I say?

00:37:20.905 --> 00:37:22.073
Sorry, ma'am.

00:37:22.156 --> 00:37:24.700
I will open the door now.

00:37:44.804 --> 00:37:50.059
I do wonder how the young widow will react
to the letter when she reads it.

00:37:57.650 --> 00:37:59.568
If you bid me to cease at once,

00:38:00.611 --> 00:38:04.198
I could still stop that letter
from reaching the young widow's eyes.

00:38:05.032 --> 00:38:06.325
Just say the word.

00:38:06.867 --> 00:38:08.035
What shall I do…

00:38:12.748 --> 00:38:13.958
dear cousin?

00:38:18.296 --> 00:38:19.755
Let's see what happens.

00:38:19.839 --> 00:38:21.340
Let's push it to the end.

00:38:53.539 --> 00:38:54.790
Where is… Ah.

00:38:55.458 --> 00:38:56.459
Here it is.

00:39:40.503 --> 00:39:42.338
You there!

00:39:46.675 --> 00:39:48.469
You're Gye-hwa, are you not?

00:39:49.512 --> 00:39:51.263
Yes, I am, madam.

00:39:58.437 --> 00:39:59.438
Come quickly.

00:40:06.737 --> 00:40:10.366
So, in the middle of the night,
she sent you here

00:40:10.449 --> 00:40:12.785
with something belonging to Geum-ho,
is that right?

00:40:13.869 --> 00:40:15.079
Yes, madam.

00:40:15.162 --> 00:40:18.999
She said it was precious and that
I should deliver it here right away.

00:40:21.043 --> 00:40:22.461
Ah, very well.

00:40:23.045 --> 00:40:24.046
Ganghwa,

00:40:24.130 --> 00:40:27.091
you take it for now,
give it to Hui-yeon at daybreak.

00:40:27.174 --> 00:40:28.300
Yes, ma'am.

00:40:37.643 --> 00:40:39.019
Is that a tobacco container?

00:40:42.731 --> 00:40:45.818
How considerate she is.

00:40:46.402 --> 00:40:49.113
With all this happening,
she even thought of me.

00:40:49.655 --> 00:40:50.948
Take it and go inside.

00:40:51.866 --> 00:40:52.867
Yes, madam.

00:40:53.868 --> 00:40:55.453
You may go. You're dismissed.

00:40:56.036 --> 00:40:57.037
Sorry.

00:41:35.117 --> 00:41:37.703
Madam. It is I, Gye-hwa.

00:41:38.204 --> 00:41:39.830
May I have your leave to enter?

00:41:49.632 --> 00:41:51.509
I humbly apologize, madam.

00:41:51.592 --> 00:41:52.968
The Lady of the First Rank…

00:41:54.136 --> 00:41:55.596
…took the tobacco box.

00:42:00.309 --> 00:42:02.186
What about the letter that was in the box?

00:42:02.269 --> 00:42:03.270
That too.

00:42:03.854 --> 00:42:06.190
This is my fault.
Please do not forgive me.

00:42:06.273 --> 00:42:08.692
I will accept any punishment.

00:42:10.945 --> 00:42:11.946
Gye-hwa.

00:42:12.446 --> 00:42:13.447
Yes, ma'am.

00:42:15.866 --> 00:42:18.911
When have I ever punished you
for anything at all?

00:42:33.509 --> 00:42:35.511
Let us send my lady a present,

00:42:36.387 --> 00:42:38.347
and let's make it something fitting.